{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> is on side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/6/ec6916b50feec24773d374eaada26a95bcabc6fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PR$\" width=\"28\" height=\"12\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/a/b4a455d533200d7dfbd00731fa8bd9e8796fb803.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PQR$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/c/ddc0d690868e31082e37790552b4480943852bf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QRS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> is a straight line segment. The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/a/2da5cf8a24439fba8ea7d2679e5705ee3b060713.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   55  \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   70 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   75 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   60 \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   50 \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/c/ddc0d690868e31082e37790552b4480943852bf7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$QRS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"40\" height=\"16\" /> is a straight line segment, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/7/cf73ed41d07e37d393414e1efbcbd64a0d85f20a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\angle PRQ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/e/9cecd9ae5aef16c6565a0461742402482c42ef53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\angle PRS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"71\" height=\"14\" /> must add up to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/c/f9cca664187be34f88c90e39c1c27318474384ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m \\angle PRQ = x^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"115\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Interior_angle\" title=\"Interior angle\">interior angles</a> of a <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangle\" title=\"Triangle\">triangle</a> is always <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/0/3f0cd95f95238159d02dbcea0aca632c2928991c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />, so we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/1/9711e2c1ba3d307737a8fd318649d42ff2d5c664.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^{\\circ} + x^{\\circ} + x^{\\circ} + 30^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"208\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/e/dfe82c6aa32aa35d442ddfe492318a669b25e210.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^{\\circ} = 180^{\\circ} - 30^{\\circ} = 150^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"195\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/2/b92443c3e23a10ded1ccf06fc2b88999a7d22a87.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{150^{\\circ}}{3^{\\circ}} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"163\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat\">2014 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Pro